CMP0077 developer warning validation

A wrapper CMake project sets BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=0 as a normal variable, then adds the bundled cmark directory. This reproduces the parent/child policy interaction that previously emitted a CMP0077 developer warning.

libraries/cmark/CMakeLists.txt now sets CMP0077 to NEW when the policy is available, before calling option(BUILD_SHARED_LIBS ...).

Results:
- Fresh CMake configure completed without the CMP0077 developer warning.
- CMake asserted the cmark target type was STATIC_LIBRARY.
- The cmark static library compiled successfully (20 Ninja steps).

Logs: cmark-cmp0077-configure.log and cmark-cmp0077-build.log.
